      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colbert%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "William Colbert gained influence in the fur trade by marrying the eldest daughter of a Chickasaw chief.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colbert%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Colbert men, including George and Levi Colbert, became prominent leaders and chiefs among the Chickasaw for two centuries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
